     "ex": "\"Let’s start with the low-hanging fruit — the duplicate emails.\"\n\"The Slack alert is a quick win; the client will see it on day one.\"\n\"Will a new dashboard really move the needle on sales?\"\n\"Before we dive into details, here’s the big picture.\""
